scn 1
# Overtaking within one click (2026-11-15; tools/legion_overtake_test.py): the column of overtake-road.scn -- 12 bodies
# single file walking north, slow 2x2 (speed 1.15, an Aramon Archer's) and fast 3x3 (2.9, an Aramon Knight's) mixed --
# sent with ONE right-click to one point 144 cells ahead, as a player sends a mixed selection. Asset-free.
# A road 8 cells wide for 160 cells, move order.
name overtake-click-road
ticks 5000
players 1
weapons off
map flat 128 200
wall 0 40 57 160
wall 65 40 63 160
type slow mover 2 2500 1 1.15
type fast mover 3 2500 1 2.9
group S0 0 slow 1 cells 60,150
group F1 0 fast 1 cells 60,152
group F2 0 fast 1 cells 60,155
group S3 0 slow 1 cells 60,158
group F4 0 fast 1 cells 60,160
group S5 0 slow 1 cells 60,163
group S6 0 slow 1 cells 60,165
group F7 0 fast 1 cells 60,167
group S8 0 slow 1 cells 60,170
group F9 0 fast 1 cells 60,172
group S10 0 slow 1 cells 60,175
group F11 0 fast 1 cells 60,177
at 5 move S0,F1,F2,S3,F4,S5,S6,F7,S8,F9,S10,F11 60 6
